891
00:32:47,919 --> 00:32:53,440
equals negative lambda * n.

892
00:32:51,919 --> 00:32:55,840
Here lambda is called the decay

893
00:32:53,440 --> 00:32:57,440
constant. The negative sign simply tells

894
00:32:55,840 --> 00:32:59,120
