898
00:33:03,279 --> 00:33:10,559
this. N of t= n * e to the power of

899
00:33:06,640 --> 00:33:13,200
negative lambda* t. Here n of t is the

900
00:33:10,559 --> 00:33:16,880
number of nuclei at time t and n is the

901
00:33:13,200 --> 00:33:19,760
starting number at time zero.

902
00:33:16,880 --> 00:33:21,600
