907
00:33:30,480 --> 00:33:36,399
to 1/2 equals natural log of 2 / lambda.

908
00:33:34,640 --> 00:33:38,559
So the halflife depends only on the

909
00:33:36,399 --> 00:33:40,159
decay constant.

910
00:33:38,559 --> 00:33:42,480
