1609
00:59:17,520 --> 00:59:20,520
technology.

1610
00:59:22,240 --> 00:59:25,680
When I visited companies or nuclear

1611
00:59:24,079 --> 00:59:27,839
detector vendors, they often gave me

1612
00:59:25,680 --> 00:59:30,079
